{"chapter": "stacks-morphisms", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "06MC", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$\\mathcal{X}$", "MATH_0002": "$$\n\\xymatrix{\nU \\ar[d] & F \\ar[l]^p \\ar[d] \\\\\n\\mathcal{X} & \\Spec(k) \\ar[l]\n}\n$$", "MATH_0003": "$U$", "MATH_0004": "$k$", "MATH_0005": "$U \\to \\mathcal{X}$", "MATH_0006": "$z \\in |F|$", "MATH_0007": "$\\dim_z(F) = 0$", "MATH_0008": "$U$", "MATH_0009": "$p(z)$", "MATH_0010": "$$\nU \\longrightarrow \\mathcal{X}\n$$"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-quasi-finite-at-point}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:732fcf33b10a1de539ae3c61a7a9387d03f20dc8bad65986d3ff877b96a572ee", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:9508b87314bf69a8975ed6f483ab240c0ce5915c2b218ff147746ef512f122e6", "source_text": "Let <MATH_0001> be an algebraic stack. Consider a cartesian diagram\n<MATH_0002>\nwhere <MATH_0003> is an algebraic space, <MATH_0004> is a field, and <MATH_0005>\nis locally of finite type. Let <MATH_0006> be such that <MATH_0007>.\nThen, after replacing <MATH_0008> by an open subspace containing <MATH_0009>, the morphism\n<MATH_0010>\nis locally quasi-finite.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:f47db58233fde25649ae75da4448ad07e9a9d44df5a6b22df873f50791c7772c", "unit_id": "tag:06ME:statement"}
