{"chapter": "stacks-morphisms", "node_kind": "paragraph", "parent_tag": "06MC", "placeholders": {"STRUCT_0001": "\\noindent"}, "render": {"prefix": "", "suffix": ""}, "risk_level": "R2", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:69392b937e4ddfc033f031fd28dd170ac7ded924038e9490323d15358ede1ddc", "source_text": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\nA quasi-DM stack has a locally quasi-finite ``covering'' by a scheme.\n\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:69e73f945d7f7c2d0e51eb5cbc7f7cdfc9ca3b8aa8ca8f1a6900d21b45fd1fa1", "unit_id": "tag:06MC:prose-0002"}
{"chapter": "stacks-morphisms", "node_kind": "theorem", "parent_tag": "06MC", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$\\mathcal{X}$", "MATH_0002": "$\\mathcal{X}$", "MATH_0003": "$W$", "MATH_0004": "$W \\to \\mathcal{X}$", "STRUCT_0001": "\\begin{enumerate}", "STRUCT_0002": "\\item", "STRUCT_0003": "\\item", "STRUCT_0004": "\\end{enumerate}"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{theorem}\n\\label{theorem-quasi-DM}\n", "suffix": "\\end{theorem}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:cedfe7c5bbfb00a8ef4a70e94173e0c47b04a04e03592dc34faf05f5ef2324b9", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:a7a1a7472ae3eef3790a2786659ce57f9f1020768326337fc20de60ec4391fe0", "source_text": "Let <MATH_0001> be an algebraic stack. The following are equivalent\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002> <MATH_0002> is quasi-DM, and\n<STRUCT_0003> there exists a scheme <MATH_0003> and a surjective, flat, locally finitely\npresented, locally quasi-finite morphism <MATH_0004>.\n<STRUCT_0004>\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:9ec0b9844a89397133b6011b585c8eff323c6fd4c0007e4bcbb474f220462bf3", "unit_id": "tag:06MF:statement"}
